{"seq":4,"slug":"video-encoding","title":"视频编码","stage":"DONE","category":"photography-video","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"视频编码-简介\">视频编码 简介</h1><p>视频编码（Video Encoding）是将原始视频数据压缩为可传输和存储的格式的技术体系。从每秒数十 GB 的无压缩 RAW 到几 Mbps 的流媒体码流，编码技术在&quot;质量保留&quot;与&quot;体积压缩&quot;之间进行精密的数学博弈。本 Hub 覆盖视频基础参数、压缩编解码器（H.264/H.265/AV1）、容器封装格式、以及流媒体分发技术。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"video-fundamentals","title":"视频基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/video-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"frame-rate","title":"帧率与时间基准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/video-fundamentals/frame-rate"},{"seq":2,"slug":"resolution","title":"分辨率与像素密度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/video-fundamentals/resolution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"scan-methods","title":"扫描方式与场序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/video-fundamentals/scan-methods"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"compression-codecs","title":"压缩编码","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/compression-codecs","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"h264-h265","title":"H.264/H.265 编码架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/compression-codecs/h264-h265"},{"seq":2,"slug":"av1","title":"AV1 编码与开放标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/compression-codecs/av1"},{"seq":3,"slug":"intra-inter-compression","title":"帧间帧内压缩原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/compression-codecs/intra-inter-compression"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"container-formats","title":"容器格式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/container-formats","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mp4-mov","t